### Equation for WCD:
\[
WCD_f = \sum_{h \in \text{path}} D_f^h + \text{propagation delay} \times \text{hop count} + \text{switching delay} \times \text{hop count}
\]
where:
- \(D_f^h = \text{hDev}(\alpha_f^h, \beta_f^h)\) (horizontal deviation).
- \(\alpha_f^h(t) = b_f + \rho_f \cdot t\) (arrival curve).
- \(\beta_f^h(t) = \text{idleSlope} \cdot [t - c_{\text{max}} / \text{idleSlope}]^+\) (CBS service curve).

