   - Service curve: `beta_{M_i}^h(t) = idleSlope_{M_i} * [ t - c_{M_i}^{h,max} / idleSlope_{M_i} ]^+`
   - Worst-case delay: `D_f^h = hDev(alpha_{M_i}^h, beta_{M_i}^h)`

