### Equation for WCD:
For each hop `h` along the path:
\[
D_f^h = \text{hDev}(\alpha_f^h, \beta_{M6}^h)
\]
where:
- \(\alpha_f^h(t) = b_f^h + \rho_f^h \cdot t\) (arrival curve)
- \(\beta_{M6}^h(t) = \text{idleSlope}_{M6} \cdot [t - \frac{c_{M6}^{h,\text{max}}}{\text{idleSlope}_{M6}}]^+\) (CBS service curve)

End-to-end WCD:
\[
\text{WCD}_f = \sum_{h \in \text{path}} D_f^h + \text{propagation delay} + \text{switching delay}
\]

