For each hop `h` along the path:
\[
D_f^h = \frac{l_f}{\text{IdleSlope}} + \text{Propagation Delay} + \text{Switching Delay}
\]
\[
\text{WCD}_f = \sum_{h \in \text{path}} D_f^h
\]

