### Equation for WCD:
For each hop \( h \):
\[
D_f^h = \sup_{t \geq 0} \left\{ \inf \{ \tau \geq 0 : \alpha_f^h(t) \leq \beta_{M_i}^h(t + \tau) \} \right\}
\]
Where:
- \( \alpha_f^h(t) \) is the arrival curve at hop \( h \).
- \( \beta_{M_i}^h(t) \) is the CBS service curve at hop \( h \).

The total WCD is the sum of per-hop delays plus propagation and switching delays.

