   - The **per-hop delay** is calculated using the **horizontal deviation** between the arrival curve and service curve:
     \[
     D_f^h = \text{sup}_{t \geq 0} \left\{ \inf \{ \tau \geq 0 : \alpha_{M_i}^h(t) \leq \beta_{M_i}^h(t + \tau) \} \right\}
