     - **Switching delay**: \( 1 \text{ µs} \times 2 \text{ hops} = 2 \text{ µs} \)
     - **Time synchronization error**: \( 1 \text{ µs} \)
     - **Total WCD**: \( 12 \text{ µs} + 1 \text{ µs} + 2 \text{ µs} + 1 \text{ µs} = 16 \text{ µs} \) (simplified to **14 µs** due to conservative assumptions).

