### **Equation for WCD Calculation:**
For each hop \( h \):
\[
D_f^h = \frac{b_f}{\text{idleSlope}^h} + \frac{l_{M_i}^{h,max}}{C} + \text{switching delay}
\]
**Total WCD:**
\[
WCD_f = \sum_{h \in \text{path}} D_f^h + \text{propagation delay} \times \text{hop count}
\]

