- \( \alpha_f^h(t) \) = Arrival curve (deconvolved with previous hop latency).
- \( \beta_{M_i}^h(t) \) = CBS service curve (rate-latency form).

The final WCD is the sum of per-hop delays plus propagation/switching delays.

