### Equation for WCD:
For each flow `f`:
\[
WCD_f = \sum_{h \in \text{path}} D_f^h + \text{propagation\_delay} \times (\text{hop\_count} + 1) + \text{switching\_delay} \times \text{hop\_count}
\]
where:
\[
D_f^h = \text{hDev}(\alpha_{M_i}^h, \beta_{M_i}^h)
\]
and:
\[
\beta_{M_i}^h(t) = \text{idleSlope}_{M_i}^h \cdot \left[ t - \frac{c_{M_i}^{h,\text{max}}}{\text{idleSlope}_{M_i}^h} \right]^+
\]

